-- 215: Carry the retired role classification over as activities for the last
-- people who had none, without cited evidence (operator decision 2026-09-30:
-- treat the obvious as obvious). Soviet institution lines -> function, Soviet
-- affiliation and officeId (state-head -> legislature); researchers/theorists ->
-- scholarship and writers/artists -> arts with the affiliation unresolved.
-- Each row is marked basis 'legacy-classification' (person-activities.js):
-- writers cannot add such rows, only keep or replace them. The one person
-- with no classification at all (agnessa-mironova) is left as is.
-- Only rows that still have no activities are touched.

BEGIN;
